--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Mandate --frozen on uv run to stop uv.lock poisoning deploys
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Context:
A deploy to dev-lakebase-07x crashed ~45s after reporting "App started
successfully". Root cause: the documented routine test command,
`uv run pytest -q -m "not scenario"`, omits `--frozen`. A bare `uv run`
performs an implicit re-resolve against `pypi-proxy.dev.databricks.com` and
rewrote all 3990 package URLs in `uv.lock`. The git tree was clean at deploy
pre-flight but was poisoned by the test run that followed, so `make deploy`
shipped the rewritten lock. In the container, `uv run --frozen` obeyed the proxy
URLs and timed out fetching `click==8.4.2` (published 2026-06-24, not cached by
the proxy), killing the app.

`.cursor/09-package-management.mdc` already warned about bare `uv lock` /
`uv sync` but never named `uv run`, and every other instruction file modelled
the unsafe form. Fix: make `--frozen` the documented default everywhere and
name `uv run` explicitly as a lock-rewriting command. The lockfile itself was
restored with `git checkout -- uv.lock` and redeployed; no source change.

Changes:

1. `.cursor/09-package-management.mdc`
   Add `uv run` to the list of commands that re-resolve against the proxy, with
   a note that it syncs implicitly and is the easiest to trip over. Add a rule
   to re-check `git status` after any `uv` command and before deploying.
2. `.cursor/08-testing-and-deployment.mdc`
   Routine/e2e/scenario commands now use `uv run --frozen`; state that the flag
   is not optional and cross-reference the package-management rule.
3. `.cursorrules`
   Both post-change and code-review test commands use `uv run --frozen`.
4. `.claude/skills/deploy/SKILL.md`
   Pre-flight test step uses `--frozen`; require re-verifying the lock
   immediately before `make deploy`; add a post-deploy step to re-check
   `app_status.state` a minute after success, since a single immediate
   `/healthz` 200 does not prove health.
5. `.claude/skills/changelog/SKILL.md`, `code-review/SKILL.md`,
   `refactoring/SKILL.md`
   Test commands use `uv run --frozen`.
6. `README.md`, `CONTRIBUTING.md`
   Routine, live-integration, and live-e2e commands use `uv run --frozen`, with
   a short explanation and a new pre-commit check that `uv.lock` is clean.

Modified files:
- `.cursorrules`
- `.cursor/08-testing-and-deployment.mdc`
- `.cursor/09-package-management.mdc`
- `.claude/skills/deploy/SKILL.md`
- `.claude/skills/changelog/SKILL.md`
- `.claude/skills/code-review/SKILL.md`
- `.claude/skills/refactoring/SKILL.md`
- `README.md`
- `CONTRIBUTING.md`

